{"meta":{"id":"basic-commands","category":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux","title":"기본 명령어","subtitle":"(Rocky Linux)","summary":"dnf, rpm, systemctl 중심 기본 명령어","tags":["리눅스","로키리눅스","rocky linux","명령어","dnf"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-commands","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-300/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-600\"></span>\n      로키 리눅스 3\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Linux Basics</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    기본 명령어 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-teal-600 font-serif\">(Rocky Linux)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/80 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> RHEL 계열 패키지 관리(dnf/rpm) 중심 명령어\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-600\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">로키 리눅스는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">DNF</strong> 패키지 매니저를 기본으로 사용함 (YUM의 후속)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">dnf</code>는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">rpm</code>의 상위 도구로 의존성까지 자동으로 해결함</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서비스/방화벽 관리는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">systemctl</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">firewall-cmd</code>를 함께 씀</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-600\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">자주 쓰는 기본 명령어</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">7개 명령어</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[30%]\">구분 및 명령어</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[34%]\">예시</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[36%]\">설명</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[갱신]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">dnf update</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">sudo dnf update</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">설치된 패키지 전체 업데이트</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[설치]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">dnf install</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">sudo dnf install vim</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">새 패키지 설치</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-rose-700 bg-rose-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[제거]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">dnf remove</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">sudo dnf remove vim</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">패키지 제거</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[조회]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">rpm -qa</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">rpm -qa | grep vim</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">설치된 패키지 목록 확인</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[서비스]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">systemctl</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">systemctl start sshd</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">서비스 시작/상태 확인/제어</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[방화벽]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">firewall-cmd</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">firewall-cmd --add-port=80/tcp</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">방화벽 포트/서비스 허용 설정</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-cyan-700 bg-cyan-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[로그]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">journalctl</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">journalctl -u sshd</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">systemd 서비스 로그 조회</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">알아두면 좋은 점</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">dnf autoremove</code>로 더 이상 필요 없는 의존성 패키지를 정리할 수 있습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">방화벽 규칙 변경 후에는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">firewall-cmd --reload</code>로 반영해야 합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">EPEL 저장소 추가 후에는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">사용 가능한 패키지 범위가 크게 넓어집니다.</strong></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Linux Basics Guide</span>\n  <span>Rocky Linux</span>\n</div>\n","path":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux/basic-commands","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"linux","title":"리눅스","path":"it/linux"},{"id":"linux-types","title":"리눅스 종류","path":"it/linux/linux-types"},{"id":"rocky-linux","title":"로키 리눅스 (Rocky Linux)","path":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux"}],"hasImage":false}